@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@taskId = 1

### Health: process liveness, not a database readiness probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Create (201); copy returned data.id into taskId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "完成后端第一阶段",
  "description": "任务接口与测试",
  "plannedFocusMinutes": 25,
  "status": "TODO",
  "plantType": "fern"
}

### Filter and paginate
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?page=1&size=20&status=TODO&title=后端&sortBy=createdAt&direction=desc

### Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}

### Replace editable fields (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "完成后端第一阶段",
  "description": "开始联调",
  "plannedFocusMinutes": 50,
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "plantType": "daisy"
}

### Complete (repeat safely)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/complete

### Repeat complete: same completedAt and updatedAt
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/complete

### Logical delete (200); physical row retained; repeat returns 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}

### Validation example (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"", "plannedFocusMinutes":0, "status":"TODO"}

### Missing task (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/9223372036854775807

### Invalid sort (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?sortBy=title
